<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to August 30.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to August 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in the Eurobond and related markets rose to $868.62 billion in the week to August 30 from $815.75 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association figures show (in billions of dollars).</p>
<p>					 Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		    32.30		40.71</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    17.49		22.47</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 836.33	     775.04</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues   139.29	     151.08</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear     634.26	     586.17</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	   234.37	     229.59</p>
